{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……話雖這麼說，還是好漫長呢。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2148", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到了第二天，班上就飄散著一股疲憊感……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然考試開始後就必須全力衝刺，但相對的精神上的疲勞也來得很迅速。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在某種意義上，或許第一天的振奮直接就導致了隔天一早的消沉。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考了之後發現自己努力得還不夠，這就是太天真的證據。大家都太不像話了。」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": "ar4089", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一針見血呢。這種鋒利就是年級榜首的秘訣啊安潔懂了。」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2149", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，安潔雖然一直碎碎念，卻沒什麼疲倦的感覺欸？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "ht0366", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會妳其實很有把握！？只有妳一個人這樣太狡猾了！」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0377", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不是的，不是那樣……」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2150", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是因為安潔有主人在。所以不管發生什麼事每天都Happy到不行呢。」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2151", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「居然趁機放閃！」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 237, "voice": "ht0367", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早知道就不要提了……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 230, "voice": "sn0378", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君則是已經完全習慣安潔這種發言了……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": "ar4090", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說，我也是每天都很Happy喔。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這男的又這樣隨口就……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": "ar4091", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「班上開開心心的只有我們呢，啊哈哈。」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2152", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其實我內心是有點抱歉的。我環顧整間教室。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯～沒有精神的感覺……", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2153", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了，主人！」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2154", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯。怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有一點時間，安潔久違地幫大家泡個茶吧！」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2155", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來～幫大家倒茶囉～」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2156", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是，眼前就出現了許久不見的景象。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔用神乎其技的手法泡好了茶，帶著親切的笑容幫班上的同學們倒茶。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請慢用。可以舒緩情緒喔！」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2157", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔喔……！」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": "da0046", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來，請慢用。趁熱喝吧，請用請用。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2158", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝安潔！」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sb0049", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會，呵呵。能讓各位高興安潔也覺得很開心～」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2159", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喔喔，教室的氣氛很快就變得溫馨愉快了……", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～♪」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2160", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來，新的一壺泡好了喔！大家會喝吧，吶？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2161", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然會喝！」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 232, "voice": "jb0032", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇～好久沒喝到安潔的茶了～」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 231, "voice": "ja0060", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「失去之後才懂得珍惜……啊啊，有女僕在的日子真的很幸福。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 233, "voice": "jc0055", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「討厭啦，大家真會誇獎～聽到這些話，安潔不就又想幫大家續杯了嗎？」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "ag2162", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拜託妳了，拜託！」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 233, "voice": "jc0056", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎不只是茶，連安潔本身的存在都大受好評。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "失去之後才懂得珍惜嗎……", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的確現在是我獨佔了安潔吧。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，但是我正是想獨佔……」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 227, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過……野生女僕時期的安潔果然是「大家的女僕」呢。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我必須連同大家的份一起珍惜安潔。嗯，要讓她幸福才行。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_25.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就這樣想著，度過了一天天的考試。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
